      "limitation_id": "candidate-evaluation-boundary",
      "text": "Candidate source and isolated native installation only; publication, normal installation and global activation remain separate gates. Two AB/BA pairs on one fixed synthetic 24/4/4-case workload with gpt-6-astra/high are descriptive, not a significance test or general speed guarantee. Both modes use the opt-in pool protocol with one versus two workers. Isolated global skill context differs from the original pilot; do not attribute cross-pilot speed differences to the hook fix. Native hook successes used no-receipt turns. Valid receipt handoff/replay is tested separately through real cmd.exe and PowerShell subprocesses. Exact grading does not establish general semantic quality. Original failed-hook pilot evidence remains historical counterevidence."
    }
